        "content": "## Fail-soft document processing\n\nThe Baserow metadata row is created before CV and cover-letter generation.\n\nIf any protected content, preparation, or document-rendering node fails, its error output goes to **Skip Failed Document Generation**, which returns to **Loop Over Jobs**. The metadata row remains stored and the next scraped job is processed.\n\nProtected nodes:\n- Create Tailored CV Content\n- Prepare CV Document\n- Generate CV Files\n- Prepare Cover Letter Input\n- Create Cover Letter Content\n- Prepare Cover Letter Document\n- Generate Cover Letter Files",
